In loop(), compute forward = -gamepad1.left_stick_y, strafe = gamepad1.left_stick_x, turn = gamepad1.right_stick_x.

Apply the mecanum formula from before to set all four motors:

frontLeft.setPower(forward + strafe + turn);
frontRight.setPower(forward - strafe - turn);
backLeft.setPower(forward - strafe + turn);
backRight.setPower(forward + strafe - turn);
